{"id":"5cac6460c6fc0b98","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-selection-rule.md","title":"单调位置选择规则","display":"df-selection-rule — 单调位置选择规则","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-selection-rule","aliases":["43-df-selection-rule"],"display":"df-selection-rule — 单调位置选择规则","depends_on":["[[43-df-string]]","[[43-df-computable]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§12.1 Definition 12.1.1，印刷326–327，PDF346–347","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"formalization-reviewed","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-selection-rule"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-selection-rule</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-selection-rule — 单调位置选择规则"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1cb4649e6af56ba4\" href=\"?note=1cb4649e6af56ba4\" title=\"43-df-string\">43-df-string</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§12.1 Definition 12.1.1，印刷326–327，PDF346–347"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\rightharpoonup\\{0,1\\}\">\\(r:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\rightharpoonup\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；有限串与可计算性见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1cb4649e6af56ba4\" href=\"?note=1cb4649e6af56ba4\" title=\"43-df-string\">43-df-string</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r(\\sigma)\\downarrow=1\">\\(r(\\sigma)\\downarrow=1\\)</span> 表示在看到σ后选择下一位，0表示不选择。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,N,M\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n,N,M\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；部分规则遇到未定义的前缀时停止，选取位置集合由下式定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sel}_r(X):=\\{n\\in\\mathbb N:(X\\upharpoonright n,1)\\in\\operatorname{graph}(r)\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;(k&lt;n\\Rightarrow X\\upharpoonright k\\in\\operatorname{dom}(r))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sel}_r(X):=\\{n\\in\\mathbb N:(X\\upharpoonright n,1)\\in\\operatorname{graph}(r)\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;(k&lt;n\\Rightarrow X\\upharpoonright k\\in\\operatorname{dom}(r))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a_r(X,N):=|\\operatorname{Sel}_r(X)\\cap\\{n\\in\\mathbb N:n&lt;N\\}|.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a_r(X,N):=|\\operatorname{Sel}_r(X)\\cap\\{n\\in\\mathbb N:n&lt;N\\}|.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"b_r(X,N):=|\\{n\\in\\mathbb N:n&lt;N\\land n\\in\\operatorname{Sel}_r(X)\\land X(n)=1\\}|.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[b_r(X,N):=|\\{n\\in\\mathbb N:n&lt;N\\land n\\in\\operatorname{Sel}_r(X)\\land X(n)=1\\}|.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Stochastic}(X,r)\\iff\\left(\\exists M\\;\\forall N\\;a_r(X,N)\\le M\\right)\\lor\\left(\\forall\\epsilon\\in\\mathbb Q_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists M\\ge1\\;\\forall N\\;\\left(a_r(X,N)\\ge M\\Rightarrow|2b_r(X,N)-a_r(X,N)|&lt;2\\epsilon a_r(X,N)\\right)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Stochastic}(X,r)\\iff\\left(\\exists M\\;\\forall N\\;a_r(X,N)\\le M\\right)\\lor\\left(\\forall\\epsilon\\in\\mathbb Q_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists M\\ge1\\;\\forall N\\;\\left(a_r(X,N)\\ge M\\Rightarrow|2b_r(X,N)-a_r(X,N)|&lt;2\\epsilon a_r(X,N)\\right)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>采用0起始编号，规则只读取待选位之前的前缀；有限选择列自动通过。交叉相乘的频率误差式避免有限阶段的零分母。停止条件依 <a href=\"https://www.lirmm.fr/~ashen/kolmbook-eng-scan.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Shen–Uspensky–Vereshchagin 作者书稿</a> §9.11（印刷287）的部分选择规则运行定义补明；其中也说明这一版本与 Mises–Wald–Church 随机性的命名对应。停止条件已完整写入 Sel 的集合公式。</p>\n<p>来源定位沿用附件：§12.1 Definition 12.1.1，印刷326–327，PDF346–347。本轮核查形式化的内部一致性，并用上述一手定义消除部分规则的停止歧义；未重新核对原书完整证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-string","status":"resolved","id":"1cb4649e6af56ba4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-string]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-string","status":"resolved","id":"1cb4649e6af56ba4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $r:2^{<\\omega}\\rightharpoonup\\{0,1\\}$，$X\\in2^\\omega$；有限串与可计算性见 [[43-df-string]]、[[43-df-computable]]。$r(\\sigma)\\downarrow=1$ 表示在看到σ后选择下一位，0表示不选择。$n,N,M\\in\\mathbb N$；部分规则遇到未定义的前缀时停止，选取位置集合由下式定义。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $r:2^{<\\omega}\\rightharpoonup\\{0,1\\}$，$X\\in2^\\omega$；有限串与可计算性见 [[43-df-string]]、[[43-df-computable]]。$r(\\sigma)\\downarrow=1$ 表示在看到σ后选择下一位，0表示不选择。$n,N,M\\in\\mathbb N$；部分规则遇到未定义的前缀时停止，选取位置集合由下式定义。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"r:2^{<\\omega}\\rightharpoonup\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"r(\\sigma)\\downarrow=1","display":false},{"tex":"n,N,M\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sel}_r(X):=\\{n\\in\\mathbb N:(X\\upharpoonright n,1)\\in\\operatorname{graph}(r)\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;(k<n\\Rightarrow X\\upharpoonright k\\in\\operatorname{dom}(r))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"a_r(X,N):=|\\operatorname{Sel}_r(X)\\cap\\{n\\in\\mathbb N:n<N\\}|.","display":true},{"tex":"b_r(X,N):=|\\{n\\in\\mathbb N:n<N\\land n\\in\\operatorname{Sel}_r(X)\\land X(n)=1\\}|.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Stochastic}(X,r)\\iff\\left(\\exists M\\;\\forall N\\;a_r(X,N)\\le M\\right)\\lor\\left(\\forall\\epsilon\\in\\mathbb Q_{>0}\\;\\exists M\\ge1\\;\\forall N\\;\\left(a_r(X,N)\\ge M\\Rightarrow|2b_r(X,N)-a_r(X,N)|<2\\epsilon a_r(X,N)\\right)\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":2184,"backlinks":[{"id":"00b50f9887ef4bac","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$；$r$ 遍历 $2^{<\\omega}\\rightharpoonup\\{0,1\\}$，$\\operatorname{Stochastic}$ 见 [[43-df-selection-rule]]，部分可计算性见 [[43-df-computable]]；Church分支的全定义域为 $2^{<\\omega}$，通过显式 $\\operatorname{dom}(r)=2^{<\\omega}$ 表达总性。"},{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-255","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-selection-rule]] — 单调位置选择规则"},{"id":"0e157dc774509959","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $E$ 是总选择函数 $r:2^{<\\omega}\\to\\{0,1\\}$ 的可数集合，$\\operatorname{Stochastic}$ 见 [[43-df-selection-rule]]。"}],"outgoing":["1cb4649e6af56ba4","f357216a7edb035a"]}